{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Crit Happens!</i> </strong>is a<strong> dice-building, turn-based roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you get to <strong>customize</strong> your dice for each encounter! In <i><strong>Crit Happens!</strong></i> you'll <strong>roll</strong> your dice before attacking, choosing which dice to <strong>hold</strong> and which dice to <strong>re-roll</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/TurnExampleGIFVideo.gif?t=1747329634\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding new <strong>dice faces</strong> on your journey and crafting them onto your dice will allow you to apply <strong>special effects</strong> to your attacks! Upgrading your dice will be essential to conquering the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/DiceCraftingGIFVideo.gif?t=1747329634\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire powerful <strong>trinkets</strong> and <strong>relics</strong> as you travel through these dangerous lands, changing the way you think about each turn. Do you <strong>hold</strong> or do you <strong>roll</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/TreasureGIFVideo.gif?t=1747329634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your dice as you play, enhancing your strength as you continue your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are a variety of dice faces you'll find on your adventure, each with its own unique effect that can be applied to your attacks. You'll get to fully customize each of your dice each time you find a new face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Change the way you play by discovering new trinkets and relics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trinkets can be found throughout your journey; each affecting the way your attack is calculated. Each turn will cycle through your collection of trinkets, forcing you to tackle each turn from a different perspective. Relics offer permanent effects, empowering certain dice faces, or simply increasing your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Journey across the dangerous, ever-shifting lands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is ever-chaning, with no two runs being the same. Travel through harsh deserts and blistering snowstorms, as you choose your path via your trusty map. Will you prioritize safe havens, or brave the elite enemies in hope of rewards?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711540?t=1747329634","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/3e73b39d895c9128c47f637788556f087bc9ce69/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747329634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/e1495971c6771ec59c794e956816f8d3f3703f70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747329634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/e1495971c6771ec59c794e956816f8d3f3703f70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747329634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Crit Happens!</i> </strong>is a<strong> dice-building, turn-based roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you get to <strong>customize</strong> your dice for each encounter! In <i><strong>Crit Happens!</strong></i> you'll <strong>roll</strong> your dice before attacking, choosing which dice to <strong>hold</strong> and which dice to <strong>re-roll</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/TurnExampleGIFVideo.gif?t=1747329634\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding new <strong>dice faces</strong> on your journey and crafting them onto your dice will allow you to apply <strong>special effects</strong> to your attacks! Upgrading your dice will be essential to conquering the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/DiceCraftingGIFVideo.gif?t=1747329634\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire powerful <strong>trinkets</strong> and <strong>relics</strong> as you travel through these dangerous lands, changing the way you think about each turn. Do you <strong>hold</strong> or do you <strong>roll</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/extras/TreasureGIFVideo.gif?t=1747329634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your dice as you play, enhancing your strength as you continue your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are a variety of dice faces you'll find on your adventure, each with its own unique effect that can be applied to your attacks. You'll get to fully customize each of your dice each time you find a new face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Change the way you play by discovering new trinkets and relics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trinkets can be found throughout your journey; each affecting the way your attack is calculated. Each turn will cycle through your collection of trinkets, forcing you to tackle each turn from a different perspective. Relics offer permanent effects, empowering certain dice faces, or simply increasing your health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Journey across the dangerous, ever-shifting lands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is ever-chaning, with no two runs being the same. Travel through harsh deserts and blistering snowstorms, as you choose your path via your trusty map. Will you prioritize safe havens, or brave the elite enemies in hope of rewards?</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio Alone"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711540/d8f9e083b54768e0d937d2003b1c1fbfa36b4c4f/header.jpg?t=1747329634","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134023,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134023/movie480.mp4?t=1747252973","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134023/movie_max.mp4?t=1747252973"},"name":"Crit Happens! Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134023/2a300e9f3f30929ed3a8f5590e89e36c1f916d6f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747252973","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134023/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747252973","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134023/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747252973"}}],"name":"Crit Happens!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 m380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum Requirements are subject to change</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Studio Alone"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","ratin